# D-6 ruling: minimal sdist (tests/docs/repo scaffolding stay out;
# downstream verification rides the GitHub Release SBOM + source tag).
# Newer setuptools sdist defaults started grafting tests/ (A9 rehearsal
# catch, run 35176638052) — the prunes make the contract mechanical.
prune tests
prune docs
prune packaging
prune container
prune vendor
prune workbench
prune scripts
prune tools
prune .github
prune .tools
